		(property "Function" "Provides U3's local high-frequency +3V3_A bypass (EMC rule R60: 0.1 uF within 3 mm of copper path). Place directly at U3 pin 8 (pad 1 within ~0.5 mm) with its GND via at pad 2; +3V3_A arrives through a via beside pin 8 from the B.Cu +3V3_A trunk. 0402 so it fits between U3 and the U13 ADC island."
