		(property "Function" "Feeds +3V0_REF into U13 REFIO on its own branch. It bounds internal-buffer contention and back-drive, isolates C103 from U5 and U8 VREF+, and keeps the power-down REFIO lag small. The value is bench-gated (Bench 2); 100R requires a REFIO clamp. Place north-west of U13 at the end of the B.Cu reference branch."
