		(property "Function" "Provides bulk energy storage on the protected battery rail. Place near the power entry and regulator feeds with short supply/ground paths; retain polarity, voltage margin and startup-surge checks. POSCAP TQC B2 1.9 mm, 25 V, 100 mOhm, damps the ~65 mm VSYS_U7 branch (Q ~0.39, no peak); a 0.5 A/10 us step dips 0.23 V, inside the LT3045 headroom; never replace with a ceramic."
